<main>
<p class="l-kicker">Weekly metrics &middot; Payments</p>
<h1>Payments, week 43</h1>
<p class="l-lede">Checkout recovered after the tax fix shipped on Tuesday. Abandonment is back to where it was in
September.</p>
<div class="l-kpis">
<div class="l-kpi"><span>p95 checkout</span><b>430&nbsp;ms</b></div>
<div class="l-kpi"><span>Abandoned at payment</span><b>8.3%</b></div>
<div class="l-kpi"><span>Authorizations</span><b>212,400</b></div>
</div>
<figure>
<figcaption>p95 checkout by day, in milliseconds</figcaption>
<svg viewBox="0 0 640 160" role="img" aria-label="p95 checkout fell from 1,180 ms on Monday to 430 ms by Sunday">
<polyline fill="none" stroke="var(--l-accent)" stroke-width="3" points="20,20 115,24 210,96 305,118 400,124 495,128 590,130"/>
<line x1="20" y1="140" x2="620" y2="140" stroke="var(--l-rule)"/>
</svg>
</figure>
<h2>What changed</h2>
<p>The tax quote now makes one call per cart. The fraud check moved back to submit time on Wednesday.</p>
<div class="l-callout">Declines at submit rose from 1.1% to 1.4%, as expected once the check runs there again.</div>
